RASSCF tests with a true RAS partition (RAS1 and/or RAS3 orbitals > 0 in a
&RASSCF block; GAS tests are not included).

The inputs are symbolic links to the tests in their original groups, which
stay where they are; the test name is <group>_<name>. There are no default
dot files, only .rasscf_ras, so the group never runs by default:

  ./pymolcas verify rasscf_ras
  ./pymolcas verify .rasscf_ras

A checkfile regenerated here (--generate) is written through the link into the
original test.
